Usage of golem index:
  -allow-destination value
    	admit a remote model destination: "<provider>/<canonical base URL>" (repeatable; this command never prompts)
  -config string
    	path to models.json (default: auto-discover)
  -full
    	clean rebuild (drop the existing index first)
  -no-color
    	disable dim ANSI footers in summary
  -ollama-url string
    	override Ollama base URL
  -progressive
    	generate opt-in L0/L1 progressive source summaries
  -root string
    	workspace root to index (default ".")
